  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/291874/description_f7657f10-a3e4-4403-a941-928f5bd774ba.png\" alt=\"Serene Seasons Logo\" width=\"336\" height=\"160\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252fglitchfiend.bsky.social\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/291874/description_30ec20ea-5378-428a-bd0a-be21297b5ed5.png\" alt=\"在Bluesky关注\" width=\"220\" height=\"38\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fGlitchfiend\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/291874/description_f430a7ef-e185-440d-b5b3-99734548f12c.png\" alt=\"在X关注\" width=\"168\" height=\"38\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/GyyzU6T\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/291874/description_7d333cda-4140-43b3-bbf2-d0644e385d2b.png\" alt=\"加入Discord\" width=\"212\" height=\"38\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Adubbz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/291874/description_db9999be-2c6a-45e2-8b5a-ac137a40758d.png\" alt=\"在Patreon支持\" width=\"236\" height=\"38\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fbusiness%253dAdubbzG%2540gmail.com%2526cy_code%253dUSD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/291874/description_4b997f21-953a-40bf-9b62-4142c6df34e4.png\" alt=\"通过PayPal捐赠\" width=\"218\" height=\"38\"></a></p><h2>介绍</h2><hr><h4>Serene Seasons 是一个为Minecraft添加季节的模组。草地和树叶的颜色会随季节变化，在冬季，温度会发生变化，使得一些原本不会下雪的生物群系也能降雪。季节还会影响作物生长、天气等各种其他特性！</h4><h2>信息与条款</h2><hr><h3>需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/glitchcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/291874/description_a952cee2-0572-4d67-a33c-f5bfde8f4376.png\" alt=\"GlitchCore图标\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/glitchcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GlitchCore</a> 用于Minecraft 1.20.4及以上版本*！Fabric版本还需要<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>。</h3><p><em>*模组版本9.1.0.0及以上也要求1.20.1版本使用</em></p><p><em>您可以将此模组包含在CurseForge托管的整合包中，但前提是不能重新托管模组，只能使用我们直接上传的构建版本，不能通过任何方式出售整合包或额外模组访问权限，并且必须遵守您所使用的模组版本许可协议中的所有条款。</em></p><h2>更多来自Glitchfiend的作品</h2><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/291874/description_f51ae5df-ff9f-4a50-a39e-16467fb0e877.png\" alt=\"Biomes O' Plenty 标志\" width=\"336\" height=\"160\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tough-as-nails\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/291874/description_6406d094-d853-4f83-b92b-49accc3b5fd7.png\" alt=\"Tough As Nails 标志\" width=\"336\" height=\"160\"></a></p>",
